{
  "name": "Nevnoc | AI Lead Responder",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Lead Responder\nA new lead fills in the form → Claude qualifies it (hot / warm / cold) and drafts a reply → the lead is saved to Google Sheets → the lead gets a personal reply with a booking link → you get an alert for hot leads.\n\n**Setup (5 min)**\n1. Edit **Config** with your details and booking link.\n2. Add credentials: Anthropic, Google Sheets, Gmail.\n3. In **Save to Google Sheets** paste your sheet URL. Row 1 headers:\n`Date | Name | Email | Company | Message | Score | Reason | Summary | Reply Sent`\n4. Activate, then open the form's Production URL.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1f0c3c2-5b1e-4f0a-9d4e-000000000001",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, -360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Tell us what you need",
        "formDescription": "Share a few details and we'll get back to you within minutes.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            { "fieldLabel": "Name", "placeholder": "Your full name", "requiredField": true },
            { "fieldLabel": "Email", "fieldType": "email", "placeholder": "you@company.com", "requiredField": true },
            { "fieldLabel": "Company", "placeholder": "Company name or website" },
            { "fieldLabel": "Message", "fieldType": "textarea", "placeholder": "What would you like help with?", "requiredField": true }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f0c3c2-5b1e-4f0a-9d4e-000000000002",
      "name": "Lead form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-520, 40],
      "webhookId": "6f1d8a52-3a4b-4c1e-8f7a-2d9b5e0c1a11"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "c1", "name": "businessName", "value": "Nevnoc", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "c2", "name": "ownerName", "value": "Laiba Qaiser", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "c3", "name": "ownerEmail", "value": "laibaqaiser2005@gmail.com", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "c4", "name": "bookingLink", "value": "[your booking link, e.g. https://cal.com/nevnoc/discovery]", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "c5", "name": "services", "value": "AI agents and chatbots, n8n workflow automation, custom web apps and dashboards (PostgreSQL, Express, React, Node.js), and business websites", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f0c3c2-5b1e-4f0a-9d4e-000000000003",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-300, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=New lead from the website form:\n\nName: {{ $json.Name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.Email }}\nCompany: {{ $json.Company || 'not given' }}\nMessage: {{ $json.Message }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You qualify inbound leads for {{ $json.businessName }}, a small studio that offers: {{ $json.services }}.\n\nScore the lead:\n- hot: a clear need we can solve, plus a sign they are ready (a deadline, a budget, a specific project, or asking to talk).\n- warm: relevant to our services but vague or early.\n- cold: unrelated to our services, spam, a sales pitch, or no real need.\n\nThen write the reply email they will receive, from {{ $json.ownerName }}:\n- Plain, friendly English. No more than 110 words. No buzzwords, no exclamation marks.\n- Greet them by first name and reflect their need in one sentence, so they know a person read it.\n- hot: invite them to book a free call at {{ $json.bookingLink }}.\n- warm: ask one or two short questions that would help us scope the work, then mention they can book a free call at {{ $json.bookingLink }}.\n- cold but genuine: a short, polite reply explaining what we do; no booking push.\n- spam or a sales pitch: leave reply_subject and reply_body empty.\n- Never promise prices, timelines or results.\n- Sign off with: {{ $json.ownerName }}, {{ $json.businessName }}\n\nAlso write a one-line reason for the score and a one-line summary of what they need."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f0c3c2-5b1e-4f0a-9d4e-000000000004",
      "name": "Qualify lead (AI)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [-60, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-haiku-5-5",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Claude Haiku 5.5"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f0c3c2-5b1e-4f0a-9d4e-000000000005",
      "name": "Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
